{
  "_readme": "Token-saving tools Token Economy can detect. Only tools found on the user's machine are shown. 'deteccao' lists the signals: exes (on PATH), hooks (word in an agent hook command), mcp (MCP server name registered in an agent), mcp_comando (word in the MCP server command), uso_mcp (MCP server name as it appears in agent logs, mcp__<name>__tool), skills, plugins, pastas (data paths; ~, %APPDATA%, %LOCALAPPDATA%, $XDG_* are expanded), proxy (text in an agent base URL) and projeto (files inside a project folder that show the tool was set up there). 'medicao' names the reader in economia.py, or null when the tool records no savings. Every entry was checked against the tool's own source code; add new tools with a pull request.",
  "ferramentas": [
